&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively build relationships and seek new business opportunities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate new business opportunities with prospective clients by targeting various verticals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
