&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Paid parental leave for employees who have been employed for over 6 months with full full scope of benefit after 12 months&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
