&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;A friendly, fun and open office complete with an onsite gym, gaming room and fully stocked fridge with ever changing snacks and drinks&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Regular treats and events throughout the year including massages in the office, happy hours and Rockies Open Day celebrations, to name a few&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Still not sure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
