&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Trustpilot, we&#39;re on an incredible journey. We&#39;re a profitable, high-growth FTSE-250 company with a big vision: to become the universal symbol of trust. We run the world&#39;s largest open customer review platform, and while we&#39;ve come a long way, there&#39;s still so much exciting work to do. Come join us at the heart of trust!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Solutions Engineer (SE) delivers technical sales and product consultancy services to NewBiz, partners and Customer Success. The goal for the SE is to be responsible for the free trials and to help increase win rate and deal size. The SE also helps with maintaining and increasing product knowledge in the NewBiz &amp;amp; CS departments as well as assisting with pre- and post-sales activities and tracking accordingly via Salesforce.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The SE is required to maintain a good balance in relation to product knowledge, focus on product reach and make sure that Trustpilot can close business by:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set up and run new trials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in pre-sales activities coordinated by sales reps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate pre-sales activities with allocated sales reps (sales teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely together with Support, Customer Success, Sales Ops and New Bizz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and update trial reporting accordingly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist CS in technical solutions for upsells and renewals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enterprise prioritisation including troubleshooting. Refresher &amp;amp; scope training for trials &amp;amp; supporting modular trials on Ents accounts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CS winback trials&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales clinic. Personalised sessions looking with reps at hard-to-convert leads with technical blockers(e.g. Automation issues, lack of technical knowledge etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation health checklist; ensure self-inviter methods are used only as a last resort and all other automation methods are explored before passing to CS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Presales framework for deals over a certain value. Ensure the client knows what technology is being used, how long to automate &amp;amp; integrate.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a similar technical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of e-commerce, social media, and SEO, ideally from a company working with SAAS or E-commerce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a good understanding of HTML and JavaScript.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical support and troubleshooting experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A doer who takes pride in providing a high level of service and delivering a consistent performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work in a team selling environment. You must enjoy working in a thriving environment and have an interest in supporting sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated, goal-oriented with enthusiasm and commitment to achievement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience and understanding of REST API or similar.(training provided)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of scripting or other software development experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A range of flexible working options to dedicate time to what matters to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package + bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year, with an extra 5 days holiday allocated after your 1 year anniversary (prorated)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two (paid) volunteering days a year to spend your time giving back to the causes that matter to you and your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rich learning and development opportunities are supported through the Trustpilot Academy and Blinkist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health package, pension, and full access to Headspace, a popular mindfulness app to promote positive mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central office with&amp;nbsp; a laid-back vibe and constant buzz of different languages being spoken everywhere you go It’s complete with a coffee bar, canteen, and table tennis and has a wide variety of refreshments available - you can opt-in for breakfast and lunch at an affordable price&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular opportunities to connect and get to know your fellow Trusties, including company-wide celebrations and events, ERG activities, and team socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to join the Trustpilot Social Club for a small monthly fee and attend regular social and leisure activities like go-karting, cooking classes, and escape rooms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee discounts to restaurants and shops&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Still unsure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We want everyone to feel welcome at Trustpilot. We’re excited to hear about your experiences and how you can help us create a great culture for our team. So don’t worry if you don’t tick every single box - we’d still love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KW1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Trustpilot began in 2007 with a simple yet powerful idea that is more relevant today than ever — to be the universal symbol of trust, bringing consumers and businesses together through reviews. Trustpilot is open, independent, and impartial — we help consumers make the right choices and businesses to build trust, grow and improve.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Today, we have more than 350 million reviews and 60 million monthly active users across the globe, with 149 billion annual Trustpilot brand impressions, and the numbers keep growing. We have more than 1000 employees and we’re headquartered in Copenhagen, with operations in&amp;nbsp; Amsterdam, Denver, Edinburgh, Hamburg, London, Melbourne, Milan and New York.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re driven by connection. It’s at the heart of what we do. Our culture keeps things fresh –– it’s built on the relationships we create. We talk, we laugh, we collaborate and we respect each other. We work across borders and cultures to be the universal symbol of trust in an ever-changing world. With vibrant office locations worldwide and over 50 nationalities, we’re proud to be an equal opportunity workplace with diverse perspectives and ideas.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our purpose to help people and businesses help each other is a tall order, but we keep it real. We’re a great bunch of humans, doing awesome stuff, without fuss or pretense. A successful Trustpilot future is driven by you –– we give you the autonomy to shape a career you can be proud of. If you’re ready to grow, let’s go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us at the heart of trust.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Trustpilot is committed to creating an inclusive environment where people from all backgrounds can thrive and where different viewpoints and experiences are valued and respected. Trustpilot will consider all applications for employment without regard to race, ethnicity, national origin, religious beliefs, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, neurodiversity, disability, age, parental or veteran status. Together, we are the heart of trust.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Trustpilot is a global company and our data practices are designed to ensure that your personally identifiable information is appropriately protected. Please note that your personal information will be transferred, accessed, and stored globally as necessary for the uses and disclosures stated in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://corporate.trustpilot.com/legal/for-everyone/data-privacy-notice-for-candidates/dec-2024&quot;&gt;Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;If you have a disability and would like to discuss any adjustments you might need either in submitting your application, or to the recruitment process more generally, please let us know by contacting our Talent Acquisition Team (talent.acquisition@trustpilot.com)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;quoting the role you wish to apply for.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Trustpilot, we&#39;re on an incredible journey. We&#39;re a profitable, high-growth FTSE-250 company with a big vision: to become the universal symbol of trust. We run the world&#39;s largest open customer review platform, and while we&#39;ve come a long way, there&#39;s still so much exciting work to do. Come join us at the heart of trust!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt; Self-Service Experience Lead&lt;/strong&gt; owns the self-service experience layer that coordinates across Trustpilot&#39;s customer-facing AI, knowledge, and digital experience surfaces, including the Help Center. As Trustpilot&#39;s self-service capability matures, this role provides the vital orchestration function ensuring AI agents, a governed knowledge base, and digital experience tooling work together toward a shared, inclusive goal: helping all customers effortlessly resolve their needs without requiring human intervention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sitting within our Digital Customer Support team, your mission is to bring our &quot;Smart Tools, Trusted Help&quot; vision to life. This is an empowering, end-to-end ownership role for the self-service experience — responsible for shaping what an accessible, seamless digital support experience should deliver. You will track and drive containment targets, manage the self-service roadmap to proactively solve customer challenges, and ensure that cross-functional investments across AI, knowledge, and digital tooling are sequenced collaboratively to drive meaningful, measurable outcomes for our global community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Co-create and maintain the Digital Customer Support self-service roadmap across AI agent capability, knowledge quality, and digital experience channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track, analyze, and transparently report on self-service containment rates and performance metrics, translating community data into actionable, empathetic insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a collaborative bridge between Digital Customer Support and Trustpilot&#39;s GTM, Product, and Engineering teams to ensure diverse platform needs are clearly articulated.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrate inclusive cross-functional delivery alongside your core team members responsible for scope and delivery..&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead discovery and scoping for new initiatives by listening to diverse customer voices, support trends, and multi-team stakeholder input.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nurture the Support-to-Product feedback loop, translating customer failure patterns into actionable product insights that benefit all users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion UX fixes and continuous experience improvements with Product and Engineering teams to remove barriers and eliminate root causes of customer effort.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the self-service backlog with care, ensuring intake, prioritization, and progression focus on the highest-impact improvements for our community.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce accessible, clear, and structured reporting on self-service performance and roadmap progress for leadership and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect team outputs directly to meaningful outcomes that elevate user satisfaction, including deflection, CSAT, and overall ease of service.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring 3–5+ years of experience in product management, digital operations, CX, or customer support, with a track record of owning digital products in SaaS or tech environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing a self-service or product roadmap end-to-end—from inclusive discovery and prioritization through to delivery, evaluation, and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess strong product thinking, with an ability to frame complex problems empathetically and build compelling cases for prioritization based on impact, equity, and strategic fit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring an orchestration and growth mindset, thriving in collaborative environments where you build consensus and alignment across teams without needing direct authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A data-driven decision maker who values diverse perspectives, using performance data and user insights to guide empathetic short- and long-term priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An open, adaptable, and structured communicator who easily translates technical concepts into accessible language for diverse audiences—from engineers to senior leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deeply curious about modern, accessible self-service experiences, digital support channels, and the AI-powered support landscape (AI agents, knowledge bases, digital tooling).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Value the full spectrum of self-service metrics (containment, deflection, CSAT, cost-to-serve) and understand how thoughtful experience design directly improves customer satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with agile ways of working, product frameworks (e.g., Kanban, Scrum), backlog prioritization, and collaborative discovery methodologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating ambiguity with resilience, welcoming incomplete information as an opportunity to learn, ask questions, and build trusted relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A range of flexible working options to dedicate time to what matters to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package + bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year, with an extra 5 days holiday allocated after your 1 year anniversary (prorated)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two (paid) volunteering days a year to spend your time giving back to the causes that matter to you and your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rich learning and development opportunities are supported through the Trustpilot Academy and Blinkist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive health package, pension, and full access to Headspace, a popular mindfulness app to promote positive mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central office with&amp;nbsp; a laid-back vibe and constant buzz of different languages being spoken everywhere you go It’s complete with a coffee bar, canteen, and table tennis and has a wide variety of refreshments available - you can opt-in for breakfast and lunch at an affordable price&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Regular opportunities to connect and get to know your fellow Trusties, including company-wide celebrations and events, ERG activities, and team socials&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to join the Trustpilot Social Club for a small monthly fee and attend regular social and leisure activities like go-karting, cooking classes, and escape rooms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee discounts to restaurants and shops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
