&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-functional projects to ensure impactful, timely delivery of learning initiatives with measurable results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze complex learning challenges and create tailored solutions to meet organisational needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with stakeholders across regions to identify learning gaps and develop operational solutions that move the needle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continuous development of our global Learning and Leadership Development Strategy, identifying business needs and proposing solutions that have business impact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate engaging and interactive learning experiences, from workshops to digital modules, that inspire continuous personal and professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the impact of learning initiatives, using feedback and data to inform ongoing improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor colleagues, fostering a culture of knowledge sharing and continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advocate for the learning and development priorities that will help drive Trustpilot’s success, influencing key stakeholders across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in learning and development or related fields, with a track record of success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of learning principles, methodologies, and tools to drive effective programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in designing and delivering innovative learning experiences that engage and empower.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing cross-functional learning projects, with a focus on delivering measurable impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills, able to assess learning needs and evaluate the outcomes of programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills, with the ability to influence and engage stakeholders at all levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven and proactive, with a demonstrated ability to independently meet goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A range of flexible working options to dedicate time to what matters to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive compensation package + bonus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year, increasing to 28 days after 2 years of employment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two (paid) volunteering days a year to spend your time giving back to the causes that matter to you and your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rich learning and development opportunities are supported through the Trustpilot Academy and Blinkist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension and life insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health cash plan, online GP, 24/7, Employee Assistance Plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full access to Headspace, a popular mindfulness app to promote positive mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season ticket loan and a cycle-to-work scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Central office location complete with table tennis, a gaming corner, coffee bars and all the snacks and refreshments you can ask for&lt;/li&gt;
