&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Technical Discovery: Support Account Executives in uncovering customer needs and existing system environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Product Demonstrations: Deliver tailored demos and presentations that articulate Trustpilot’s value, flexibility, and ROI.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Solution Delivery: Configure and present standard solutions that address specific customer pain points and business goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Proof-of-Concepts: Manage pilot programs to validate functional requirements and technical impact before signing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Technical Enablement: Act as a trusted advisor throughout the sales cycle — answering technical questions and resolving blockers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Work closely with Product, Engineering, and Implementation teams to ensure solution integrity and smooth handover.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Documentation &amp;amp; Knowledge Transfer: Maintain accurate documentation for proposed solutions and integration requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Feedback Loop: Capture recurring customer feedback and insights to inform product&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
