&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Trustpilot, we&#39;re on an incredible journey. We&#39;re a profitable, high-growth FTSE-250 company with a big vision: to become the universal symbol of trust. We run the world&#39;s largest open customer review platform, and while we&#39;ve come a long way, there&#39;s still so much exciting work to do. Come join us at the heart of trust!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;As a Technical Account Manager (TAM), you are the post-sales technical partner for Trustpilot’s most complex and high-value customers. You ensure smooth technical onboarding, integration success, and long-term stability by acting as the bridge between Customer Success, Product, and Engineering. You are accountable for optimizing technical performance and adoption across your portfolio — driving customer satisfaction, operational excellence, and contributing to strong Business Adoption&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;and Gross Renewal Rate (GRR) results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role bridges Customer Success and technical delivery. You are instrumental in ensuring customer satisfaction, minimizing time-to-value, and maintaining reliable integrations that enable long-term retention and advocacy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical Onboarding &amp;amp; Implementation:&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Oversee or support technical setup, API integration, and configuration for assigned customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing Technical Assistance:&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;Serve as the primary technical contact post-launch, ensuring performance, uptime, and issue resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Optimization: Partner with Customer Success Managers to monitor product usage and ensure customers fully leverage Trustpilot’s technical capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer Advocacy: Represent customer technical needs to Product and Engineering teams; drive prioritization of key issues or improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Issue Management: Manage escalation paths and coordinate resolution of critical technical incidents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Documentation: Maintain technical records, integration details, and knowledge base articles for customer reference.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration: Work closely with Product, Support, and Success to ensure a cohesive customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feedback &amp;amp; Innovation: Surface recurring issues and improvement ideas to enhance platform reliability and customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience in technical account management, implementation, or solution support within SaaS or web technology environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of APIs, web integrations, and data exchange formats (JSON, XML, REST).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting, analytical, and communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer-centric mindset with the ability to manage both technical depth and business context.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience partnering with enterprise clients and internal engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Organized, proactive, and able to manage multiple complex customers simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using Salesforce, ticketing systems, and analytics tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A good understanding of the digital advertising/search marketing industry – preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A competitive base salary of $105,000 - $120,000 gross per year (depending on level and experience), plus a competitive commission structure. The base salary range stated doesn&#39;t include any variable pay such as bonuses or commission, awards made under Trustpilot&#39;s equity program, or other benefits.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A range of flexible working options to dedicate time to what matters to you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;20 vacation days + 2 personal days +10 paid holidays per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Two (paid) volunteering days a year to spend your time giving back to the causes that matter to you and your community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Rich learning and development opportunities supported through the Trustpilot Academy, and Blinkist&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full health insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401k matching your contributions dollar-for-dollar up to 4% of your base salary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 Employee Assistance Plan and full access to Headspace, a popular mindfulness app to promote positive mental health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave for employees who have been employed for over 6 months with full full scope of benefit after 12 months&lt;/li&gt;
